**Article 344. Inadmissibility of set-off** 

Set-off of claims is not allowed: 

for which the limitation period has expired; 

on compensation for harm caused by damage to health or death to a citizen; 

on the recovery of alimony; 

on the alienation of the house with the condition of life maintenance; 

in other cases stipulated by law or contract.

